1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,320
As the world continues raising its voice for the many human sufferings across the globe,

2
00:00:06,640 --> 00:00:16,400
Congo remains ignored. It seems as though our voices echoes into emptiness. We continue crying

3
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:24,040
and it feels like no one is listening to us. When will the world understand the suffering

4
00:00:24,040 --> 00:00:33,800
of the Congolese people? The decades of bloodshed, of hunger, of unaliving of the Congolese people?

5
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:36,200
When will the world react to that?

